WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.000
1053

00:16.020 --> 00:19.780
Why? Engrave it into your chest, leader of this era!

00:16.020 --> 00:19.780
(Why?) mune ni kizame yo jidai no riidaa

00:19.780 --> 00:23.580
Who? He's cleverer than what he seems to be.

00:19.780 --> 00:23.580
(Who?) mitame yori ka ha kanari kureebaa

00:23.580 --> 00:27.540
Fool! Growing wilder than a cold heart.

00:23.580 --> 00:27.540
(Fool!) kawaita kokoro susamu yori ha

00:27.540 --> 00:30.460
Fight! If you tried crying at times,

00:27.540 --> 00:30.460
(Fight!) toki ni naite mireba

00:30.460 --> 00:35.100
you would certainly see your new self

00:30.460 --> 00:35.100
miete kuru asu kakeru no ha

00:35.100 --> 00:38.420
dashing towards tomorrow,

00:35.100 --> 00:38.420
magire mo naku atarashii jibun

00:38.420 --> 00:42.900
not for anyone's sake,

00:38.420 --> 00:42.900
dare ka no tame demo naku

00:42.900 --> 00:46.820
just aiming higher and higher.

00:42.900 --> 00:46.820
tada motto ue wo mezase

00:50.140 --> 00:52.860
Like a soaring dragon.

00:50.140 --> 00:52.860
noboru ryuu no you da

00:54.740 --> 00:58.300
The golden light and the inviting future

00:54.740 --> 00:58.300
kin no hikari ga yonda mirai ga

00:58.300 --> 01:01.980
is guiding us.

00:58.300 --> 01:01.980
michibiku n da bokura wo

01:22.180 --> 01:28.260
Saizen Staff:

01:22.180 --> 01:28.260
Translator: sangofe

01:22.180 --> 01:28.260
TLC: kokujin-kun

01:22.180 --> 01:28.260
Encoder: Edward_K

01:22.180 --> 01:28.260
Timer: Nicolai

